Z||000010||Seanh||11-01-2000||11:04 PM||||Ok Thanks. I will look at the Fiero Shop website tomarrow. I dont have a mouse on this computer and I cant seem to tab over to the part catalog link. I have a gateway with the cordless keyboard and mouse, I hate that feature. I just put a wired keyboard becuase of all the typing I do here and the cordless one would stick and skip letters. To make a long story short the cordless mouse, that I would like to have kept, will not work unless the cordless keyboard is hooked up, so thus, I have no mouse. I never thought I could live without a mouse until I had to. I am kinda getting used to it and its not really as hard as you would think.<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.kdsi.net/~sean" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/seanhsig.gif"> <BR>Sean's Fiero Page</A><BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8 Auto<BR>Going on to 3.4 in Jan.||||reg||1
